---
title: "risk_level_calculation - Obligation Health Assessment (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_fetch_prices: fetch asset prices from x_oracle
    q_fetch_prices --> q_calc_collateral: for each collateral asset in obligation
    q_calc_collateral --> q_sum_collateral: required_collateral_i = amount_i * price_i * liquidation_factor_i
    q_sum_collateral --> q_calc_debt: required_collateral_value = sum(required_collateral_i)
    q_calc_debt --> q_sum_debt: for each debt asset in obligation
    q_sum_debt --> q_calc_risk: borrow_value_weighted = sum(debt_i * price_i * borrow_weight_i)
    q_calc_risk --> q_check_zero: check required_collateral_value > 0
    q_check_zero --> q_no_collateral: required_collateral_value == 0 and debt > 0
    q_no_collateral --> [*]: risk_level = infinity (immediately liquidatable)
    q_check_zero --> q_compute: required_collateral_value > 0
    q_compute --> q_classify: risk_level = borrow_value_weighted / required_collateral_value
    q_classify --> q_healthy: risk_level < 100%
    q_healthy --> [*]: position is healthy
    q_classify --> q_unhealthy: risk_level >= 100%
    q_unhealthy --> [*]: position eligible for liquidation

    note right of q_calc_risk
        INV-001: risk_level = borrow_value_weighted / required_collateral_value
        INV-002: liquidation triggered when risk_level >= 100%
        INV-003: liquidation_factor per asset (e.g. SUI=0.8, USDC=0.9)
        INV-004: borrow_weight per asset (e.g. USDC=1.0, SUI=1.25)
    end note

    note right of q_sum_collateral
        INV-005: required_collateral_value = sum(collateral_i * price_i * liquidation_factor_i)
        INV-006: higher liquidation_factor means more of collateral counts toward threshold
    end note
